Thu Oct  8 19:30:37 UTC 2026 - Jan Engelhardt <jengelh@inai.de>

- Update to release 1.6.3
  * Fix an error in `ClosureDiagram` for gradings whose 0-component
    is a torus
  * Fix the manual entry of `SubalgebraOfClosedSet`, which was
    listed as `LieAlgebraOfClosedSet`, and correct several other
    statements and typos in the manual

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Tue Sep 10 08:55:39 UTC 2024 - Jan Engelhardt <jengelh@inai.de>

- Update to release 1.6.2
  * Add highest-weight modules: `IsIrreducibleHWModule`,
    `HighestWeight`, `HighestWeightVector`, `DisplayHighestWeight`
    and `IsomorphismOfIrreducibleHWModules`
  * Add nilpotent orbit functions `ComponentGroup`,
    `RichardsonOrbits`, `DisplayWeightedDynkinDiagram`,
    `IsRegular`, `RegularNilpotentOrbit`, `IsDistinguished` and
    `DistinguishedNilpotentOrbits`
  * Add `DisplayDynkinDiagram` and `ApplyWeylPermToCartanElement`
  * Rewrite `CharacteristicsOfStrata`: it accepts a list of highest
    weights and an optional bilinear form
  * `WeylTransversal` with an empty index list returns all Weyl
    group elements

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Sat Nov 19 01:18:59 UTC 2022 - Jan Engelhardt <jengelh@inai.de>

- Update to release 1.5.3
  * Added functionality for Weyl groups as permutation groups.
  * Some functionality for Weyl groups as perm groups, and
    branching for reductive subalgebras.

